{"id": "data/normal/4952", "subject": "● Seniro IT Engineer needed", "body": "The recruitment for one of TOP 500 is valid till July 31th and the location is BJ. Please send you cv to leo.lai@bo-le.com  I\\'ll reply or phone you when noticing your cv. Note: sorry but no internship available. \nJob duties and responsibilities: \nResponsible for building IT infra-structure for China and coordinating with company headquarters in Singapore. \nResponsibilities will include system implementation (including interface), consolidation, enhancement &amp; supports for (Yong Yoo ,Hyperion ,HRIS,MAS &amp; Web application etc) in addition to the H/W ,N/W,&amp;S/W packages. \nResponsible for data center maintenance, IT Audit documentation and implementation of security policy in China. \nPrimary duties and responsibilities: \n-Building solid infra-structure in the area ( Not limited to S/W ,H/W,N/W Development ,control ) \n-Support existing system Yong Yoo &amp; MAS and new system (BAAN) development / support in line with headquarters strategy\n-IT Audit follow-ups, documentation and support\n-General support to Headquarters\nQualification : \n-Male or Female \n-Bachelor\\'s or master\\'s Degree in computer science \n-More than 3 years experience in business application development\n-More than 5 years IT experience\n-Broad knowledge for the IT in general ( H/W,S/W,N/W, IT control and documentations etc ), prior involvement experience with ERP and SAP\n-Strong skills in problem solving\n-Able to deliver results for multiple project under tight deadlines\n-A self - motivated ,energetic team player with business acumen ,excellent analytical and interpersonal skills\n-Reasonable communication command of English to communicate with foreigners", "from": "huang <huang@tsinghua.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
