{"id": "data/normal/6844", "subject": "● 诚聘DSP人才", "body": "Paragon WirelessǿͨѶĹȸ߿Ƽҵйشз(и¼ҵ)Paragon WirelessɸҵĹ⾫ӢаIEEE 802.20鸱ϯǰNTT DoCoMoоԺܲãԼĦйϯͳżܲáҵǿ󡣹˾Ŀǰһ֧30ҵļ飬ʵǿ˾8µʱ,NORTEL,CNCȹҵ˽ܵҵϵ. ˾1000ԪʷͶʵ֧,ڹ˾ҵѸٷչParagon WirelessƸ˲š(www.parawireless.com). Ȥߣ뽫hr@parawireless.com\nƸ Speech DSP Engineer (2) \nƸ 1 \nʴ \nƸҪ Experience: \n- 1+ year experience in speech processing for telecommunications products Skills: - Deep knowledge of speech compression standards and algorithms: G.729(A/B), G.723.\n- Deep knowledge of speech processing algorithms: echo cancellation, speaker phone processing, error concealment, noise suppression and comfort noise generation\n- Working knowledge of putting the above algorithms into products \n- Expereince w. embedded DSP software development using DSP IDE tools\n- Proficient in C, C++ - Proficient in Matlab modeling and simulation \nEducation: MS+ in Digital Signal Processing (speech). \n\n", "from": "Tran Quang Anh <zeng@cernet.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
