{"id": "data/normal/3745", "subject": "● 人力资源管理咨询公司招聘", "body": "룬ϵʽ¡\nAssociate, Actuarial Consulting Practice\nAs an associate within the Employee Benefits Services Practice, you will be able to enhance your actuarial skills as you team with consultants to support clients in the areas of retirement and pension, as well as a wider mix of Human Resource initiatives.  \nResponsibilities Include: \n    Undertaking analytical work, including actuarial valuations \n    Carrying out research into legislative issues, e.g. new regulations, etc. and communicating the consulting implications to consultants and clients \n    Assisting in the preparation of client deliverables, proposals and presentations for clients\n    Resolving client queries and helping to maintain client relationship\nRequirements and Qualifications:\n    Strong educational background - degree or equivalent.\n    Making good progress through actuarial exams.\n    Well developed analytical, quantitative, interpersonal, communication and presentation skills\n    Ability to work independently and manage tight deadlines\n    1 - 2 years relevant experience preferred\n    Computer literacy - a strong understanding of Word and Excel is essential, knowledge of PowerPoint and Lotus Notes would be an advantage\n    Accuracy, attention to detail and the ability to work on own initiative to tight deadlines\nCathy Li\nHR\nUnit 1421&amp;1422, South Tower\nBeijing Kerry Centre\n1, Guanghua Road, Chaoyang District\nBeijing 100020 PRC\nFax: +8610 8529 7884\nEmailcathy.li@towersperrin.com\n\n", "from": "zheng <zheng@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
