{"id": "data/normal/7105", "subject": "Re: Chinese_rules.cf FAQ", "body": "RTL, SOC֤\nRTLԱϤverilog\n֤ԱSOC֤, BFMд, testcaseд\nһunix, perl, shell scripts, cvs\nҪ:\n     RTLʦϤVERILOG, һСĿ.\n     ֤ʦҪϤԭ, йǶʽϵͳͿ\n     һϤunixͿ\nнҵûҵ  Թ? \nļ weichyan@163.com\nվ\nӢĸһݰ, ҪӢĵ\nͷverificationԭʼrequirements JD:\nҾҪ̫, ĳ\nSOC Verification Engineer \n \nRequirement:\n*       Familiar with ASIC/SOC verification flow.\n*       Proficient in Verilog, C/C++, Unix-Shell scripting/Perl scripting.\n*       Familiar with HDL-Lint , Gate-level simulations, Equivalence checking.\n*       Minimum of MSEE or MSCS\n*       3+ Years experience\n \nJob description:\n*       Maintain SOC level test environment for regression automation.\n*       Maintain design code revision control, like CVS.\n*       Maintain flow for quality RTL deliverables for synthesis, verification, DFT, coding style and naming scheme  by use of lint programs.\n*       Maintain flow for RTL Vs. Gate-level netlist Equivalence checking.\n*       Ideal person will play a support role in the overall verification of SOC design.\n \n\n", "from": "xue <xue@cernet.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
