{"id": "data/normal/2480", "subject": "=?gb2312?B?ofEgQkU6U3IuIEh1bWFuIFJlc291cmNlIENvbnN1bHRhbnQgLSBIUiBTdXBlcnZpc29yICixsb6p", "body": "ytAp?=\nX-mailer: Foxmail 5.0 [cn]\nMime-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain;\n\tcharset=\"gb2312\"\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-MIME-Autoconverted: from base64 to 8bit by home.ccert.edu.cn id j058UaSk031027\nSender: owner-ccert_forum@home.ccert.edu.cn\nPrecedence: bulk\nX-UIDL: )-)\"!?,K\"!75\\\"!A,L\"!\n\n�� �������������� Career_MNC ������ ��\n������: Ashora (����������--��������������), ����: Career_MNC\n��  ��: BE:Sr. Human Resource Consultant - HR Supervisor (������) \n������: �������� (Thu Jul  7 18:14:19 2005), ����\nJob Summary \nThe Senior Human Resources Consultant provides HR support and some organizational consulting. Contributes to HR planning for the country, business unit or function and (with minimal supervision) implements those plans in assigned client groups. \nDuties and Responsibilities - specific tasks associated with performing this job \nTypically, with the assistance of the HR leader, implements the overall HR strategy and communicate and implement corporate initiatives \nTypically will participate in Workforce and organizational planning, leadership planning and development, performance management strategy. \nParticipates dalily operation fully in Beijing and Guangzhou office. \nPerformance Management: training on PMP; tracking non-compliance; tracking global timeline for goal-setting; review and rewards \nRetention Program: Employee Value Program, Talent Management, Individual Development Plan and Leadership Development Plan. \nOther HR related training, e.g. First-day Orientation \nVendor Management \nBaseline Proficiencies \nBachelors Degree preferred or equivalent job experience \n4 - 6 years job experience in a related field \nAbility to effectively manage projects \nAnalytical ability and decision-making skills \nRequirements \nVery strong client and business focus \nDemonstrated ability to build/maintain influential, consultative relationships with clients \nExpertise/experience in workforce-related areas \nAbility to look beyond the daily HR transactions to Understand the business, Recognize organizational trends and needs and Influence leaders in addressing those issues \nHandle multiple simultaneous tasks. \nEmail:weibin.chen@bearingpoint.com", "from": "feng <feng@ccert.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
