{"id": "data/normal/2530", "subject": "● 大家帮我看看这是什么啊 (转载)", "body": " ת Career_MNC  \n: speedgirl (ӺС//̫С//˽), : Career_MNC\n  : Ұҿʲô\nվ: ˮľ (Thu Jul  7 19:50:47 2005), վ\nһconoilĹ˾   û˸Ǹʲôط\nŵʲô˼   Ŷж\nһӡûе˵\nHwould you like to be our account manager in your region??\nso the account manager work consist:\nnow we need manager only in SHANGHAI.\nNow our company make cunsulting services for oil companies in the china\nregion-and our clients would like to\nsafe their taxes-so if they will pay money to us abroad they will pay more then\n30 % taxes.\nbecause we try to find account manager in the china region:\nfirst of all\nyou must have international Debit card(visa 0r master card).\nwe will sent money to this card.\nyou give us your card number-if you do it today we may start fast\n-so after transfer you will leave 7 % of summm to you\nand enother sent to us Wia money gram or western union(you can locete their\nservices \non thieri sites www.moneygram.com and www.westernunion.com).\nSo your card must be emitend by bank of china Shanghai branch.\nwe will wait your card numbar and start.\nand please fill this form:\n-your full name:\n-country:\n-State:\n-zip code:   \n-city: \n-e-mail:  \n-home number:\n-phone number:\n-your (bank of china) card number:\nif you afraid for your card safety-you may cash out your money from card and\ngive us empty card.\np.s.in some china regions you cant acces our site www.conoil.com -please\nrequest our offline version.\nwe will wait your responce.   \n\n", "from": "gao@rbl.ccert.edu.cn", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
